        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"50ec21da-e33d-4e49-abdc-ddf13664eb85\",\"review_text\":\"I love all the features it has to offer. Just lacking a bit on certain music. Especially in remixed songs.\"},{\"review_id\":\"ad321f54-a9d7-4943-b014-188ae9d459db\",\"review_text\":\"I like the music\"},{\"review_id\":\"d73b5e57-2c38-4813-9791-15aa3d3b441f\",\"review_text\":\"Happy customer here\"},{\"review_id\":\"efab9aef-d425-4e2d-8bf5-e0adac13f4da\",\"review_text\":\"Best for listening music\"},{\"review_id\":\"b4ea6de4-3958-4e39-9eb8-17c3f938bfd3\",\"review_text\":\"I can't play any song. It's too bad.\"},{\"review_id\":\"e838f0fa-835b-4c8e-a846-f9a643c6f14f\",\"review_text\":\"Love 💘\"},{\"review_id\":\"67a5a59d-152c-42a0-a936-0fcb8a15b2c9\",\"review_text\":\"very frequent ads\"},{\"review_id\":\"901d5176-e6ab-4df1-b9f4-1a990e9f13ac\",\"review_text\":\"Tells me to cut off my VPN to create an account. Just wanna listen to Joe Rogan talk about dmt without having my data sniped.. oh well\"},{\"review_id\":\"59bb31da-1a55-4a67-8182-6b6cc0cd8700\",\"review_text\":\"Farward button not working...\"},{\"review_id\":\"27039274-4dbf-4781-872b-efcda4a0b7c4\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify just only needs money nowadays Just starting hating this begger Spotify\"}]}"
